==Battleground==
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~14.33 seconds<sup>150f~430f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 5~14.33 seconds<sup>150f~430f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ginger Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Bore]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You should have some true forms by now. If you have [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]], etc, use them.

This stage can also be beaten using a level 30+ [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], just as along as he is properly meatshielded and there are other cheap attackers to clear the peons.

